   "as_published": "All four measurements break at the same step, and none is a capability limit. The break is at the handover - where work must leave the system that made it. So the honest form of 'what must remain human' is a boundary of consent, not of competence. Their closing line: a published address is a door, not a reply; nobody has been written to.",
